From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:15:11 +0000
Subject: feat(ohos): render inline-box spans and groups in RichText

Flatten each InlineBoxGroupSpan into leading/trailing edge placeholders,
word-joiner glue and ordinary child text so OH_Drawing measures and wraps
the children itself; single inline-box spans reserve edge placeholders
around their text. The shadow records chrome runs plus a layout-to-semantic
offset map and hands both to the main thread with the typography; the view
paints fill before glyphs and border after, and selection, copy and the
default accessibility text use the semantic string. An explicit
accessibility prop still wins over the derived text.

Fork-Patch: ohos-richtext-inline-box
Origin: 73fc777a 7602d0e1 5aea44fa
Upstream-Status: pending
Signed-off-by: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>

